Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't much time left\Nuntil the square is blown up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is already down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My voice can't, it can't be\Nheard, no matter how loud I yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the country will fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we're here, your\Nvoice will always be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My injuries are a whole lot\Nmore severe than yours are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit whining and act like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg is hurt, so I can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate tons of meat, bird guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he make it out of the\Nquicksand with all his injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy. He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony's here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Vivi's here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it all along! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For someone who knew it all\Nalong, you sure look surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Sanji, you're alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, what happened? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, too? And Mr. Bushido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, who asked you to create\Nsome useless Park for parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're standing up just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it did have a powerful\Nattack, right, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to deal with you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with all this\Ndust flying everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you let Nami\Nget injured like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fine. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Jumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bury my body out of the\Nwastelands when I'm dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Zoro, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I lost to him once already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't beat this guy, then\NI don't know anybody who can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this happened, all\Nof you are still with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try all you want, but no matter how many\Ntimes you swing, you'll never hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't get\Nenough the first time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hit Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured something out when some of\Nmy Yuba water dropped on your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you touch water, then you\Ncan't turn into sand anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took away all the rain because\Nyou're afraid of water, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how to defeat you, crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our real fight is starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In ten minutes, this place\Nis really going to blow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In ten minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not by standing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if everything in this\Narea is going to explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the cannon guy has to\Nbe far away, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else he'd just blow\Nup with the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. No. He's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannoneer is almost\Ncertainly near the palace square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means he's gonna be\Ncaught in the explosion, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that shouldn't be too surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.19,0:09:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just playing evil. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we found you\Nprincess i wonder how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,big a promotion crocodile\Nwould give us for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing you billions it\Nlooks like we'll lose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some time he's right so\Nlet's not waste all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jabra jabbering let's\Ngo i'll go ahead yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your counting is not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helping let's split up we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need to get out of this\Ndust devil if we're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find anything ten minutes\Nall right now let's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go hurry yeah this is\Nreally it this is the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last chance in ten minutes,\Nthe country's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be decided we're good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on you think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can defeat me sure do\Ni'll admit i'm impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you figured it out\Nespecially since you were
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about to die but i hope\Nyou realize something like
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that isn't nearly enough\Nto make this an even
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight i am one of the\Nseven warlords of the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so what if you're one of the seven dumb
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warlords i guess that\Nmakes me the eighth warlord
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really who is that guy he's a pirate i'm\Nsurprised you haven't heard about him yet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's helped your darling princess vivi\Nescape from death a few times now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then he is the one responsible\Nfor bringing Vivi back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I got it, then it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand can still absorb any fluid on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that matter, my hand can absorb\Nall the water in your body as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, forgot about that trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, not bad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember how you told me Devil-free
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:12:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powers Get stronger Gong-gong-pista
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shotgun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stupid heart doesn't bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just keep using the\Nsame move against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna win? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's been my plan from the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for you to get wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, your plan\Nwas out here. Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're struggling so\Nhard, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything at all without\Nthat barrel of yours, now can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this isn't any different\Nfrom my first fight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against you after all yeah\Nyou're right crocodile it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't any different like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About now, I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the same as I was, huh?\NYou gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water luffy oh no a leak you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't be serious about this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can he
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i guess i shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have drunk that much water
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does this idiot really not\Nunderstand what's going on here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, stop your messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.45,0:14:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn them, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said I was messing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always serious! Let me show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sand Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beat Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time now for\Nall this admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are going to show me\Nthe way to the Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could looking at it possibly help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is show me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your luck's beginning to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly did try, but\Nthere's not much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should get going now, Nico Robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.61,0:15:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to be dried\Nup along with this brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:15:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to destroy every\Nlast rock on this ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you alone with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the grass is drying up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grounds echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was close. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hand sucked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually thought you could\Nkill my powers, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a very foolish mistake to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The true power of sand is\Ntrying things out. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right hand can suck the life out\Nof anything by turning it to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power is limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the statues are crumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is just dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:17:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything that is connected\Nto the ground is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ground dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What impeccable timing you marines\Nhave, showing up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry. No chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to one of the soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.77,0:18:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know everything that's been\Ngoing on here in Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man, do you have any idea who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening to him, you, or\Nanyone else from the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I would strongly recommend that\Nyou and your men get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no intention of giving way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, you may not live much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be worried about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been warned that at\N4:30 a bomb is going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shot into the Palace Square\Nwhere the fighting's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to go stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's only minutes from now! If\Nthis attack happens, it'll cost
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a million citizens their lives\Nwell all right we'll save you and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we'll stop the attack wait\Nyou don't know who she is move
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Prank that mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a Devil Fruit I said I was in a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurry didn't I don't make me angry\Nwith you that's her it's really
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nicole robin i'm sure of it i\Nlooked up her old wanted poster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because captain smoker had asked\Nme to do so that's really her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she has a bounty 20 years ago the\Nwhole world was talking about her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i still remember the articles\Nthat appeared in the newspaper
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around that time in a terrifying\Nincident six marine warships
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were destroyed they said that\Nan eight-year-old girl was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,responsible for sinking them the\Ngovernment classified her as a first
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-degree risk and they put an\Nincredible bounty on her head 79
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,million berries it's still an amazing\Nsum after that she just suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disappeared stop your pointless\Nrambling either move out of my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way or you're all dead okay it's useless\Nhaving this many soldiers. Never spied her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant, take the men and head to\Nthe square to stop the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only minutes left! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let that man go right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already warned you to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.13,0:21:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right hand of his is\Ngonna be a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire lawn has been\Nturned into a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.09,0:21:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quite tired of\Nwasting my time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.43,0:22:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have lost to me two times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.17,0:22:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, Luffy.

